# Apple Intelligence & Siri
# Updated: 2026-11-10
#
# Notes:
# - Policy target: Apple AI (static: 美国节点 / direct), switch in the Quantumult X policy panel.
# - Keep every host here on ONE exit. A latency-benchmark group hops between nodes and
#   providers, so one Siri session reaches Apple from several IPs. Use an `available` group.
# - Register this list ahead of ai-all-in-one.list: that list carries
#   HOST-SUFFIX,cloudflare.com and would otherwise capture the Cloudflare relay hosts below.
# - Apple Intelligence eligibility is decided by the region the request exits from,
#   so pick a US node when it reports "not available in your region".

# ========= Siri =========
HOST-SUFFIX,guzzoni.apple.com,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,siri.apple.com,Apple AI
# iOS 27 Siri endpoint ("daily limit" errors when missing)
HOST-SUFFIX,api-siri-prod.apple.com,Apple AI
# Catch-all for other Siri hosts
HOST-KEYWORD,siri,Apple AI

# ========= Siri / Spotlight suggestions =========
HOST-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com,Apple AI
# Mainland-region suggestions endpoint, otherwise caught by Apple.list and sent direct
HOST-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.cn,Apple AI

# ========= Apple Intelligence / Private Cloud Compute relays =========
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.apple.com,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.cloudflare.com,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.akamaized.net,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,cp4.cloudflare.com,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-carry-relay.cloudflare.com,Apple AI

# ========= iCloud Private Relay (mask) =========
HOST,mask-api.fe.apple-dns.net,Apple AI
HOST,mask-api.fe2.apple-dns.net,Apple AI
HOST,mask-boot.icloud.com,Apple AI
HOST,mask-canary.icloud.com,Apple AI
HOST,mask-api.icloud.com,Apple AI
HOST,mask-t.apple-dns.net,Apple AI
HOST,mask.apple-dns.net,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,mask-h2.icloud.com,Apple AI
HOST-SUFFIX,mask.icloud.com,Apple AI

# ========= Region detection =========
# Location service used for the region check. Also carries Apple Maps
# location lookups, so Maps positioning follows this policy too.
HOST,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com,Apple AI
HOST,gsp64-ssl.ls.apple.com,Apple AI
# Wi-Fi positioning, also used for the region check
HOST,wps.apple.com,Apple AI

# ========= Broad dependency =========
# iCloud API gateway used during Apple Intelligence setup, plus its subdomains:
# attester.gateway.icloud.com is the Private Cloud Compute attestation endpoint and
# went direct while this was an exact HOST rule. It also serves general iCloud
# requests; comment it out if iCloud sync misbehaves on a US node.
HOST-SUFFIX,gateway.icloud.com,Apple AI
# iCloud reachability probe and metrics that Apple Intelligence checks alongside the relays
HOST,probe.icloud.com,Apple AI
HOST,metrics.icloud.com,Apple AI

# ========= Optional =========
# Broader location service (all Apple Maps positioning) and App Store assets.
# Uncomment if Apple Intelligence still reports region issues.
# HOST-SUFFIX,ls.apple.com,Apple AI
# HOST-SUFFIX,apps.mzstatic.com,Apple AI
